{"id":"slovom","lemma":"словом","pos":"adv","rank":2061,"glosses":["in short, in a word"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4e/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я и словом не обмолвлюсь.","en":"I won't breathe a word.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Одним словом, жизнь коротка.","en":"In a word, life is short.","words":[null,null,{"g":"life"},null]},{"text":"Одним словом, она виновна.","en":"In a word, she is guilty.","words":[null,null,{"g":"she / it"},null]},{"text":"Одним словом, он трус.","en":"In a word, he is a coward.","words":[null,null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"coward"}]},{"text":"Переведи отрывок слово за словом.","en":"Translate the passage word for word.","words":[{"g":"to lead","l":"перевести"},{"g":"fragment"},{"g":"word, term"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]}]}